"container": "\n<section class=\"section faq\"><div class=\"shell text-column regional-guide\"><h2>Western Suburbs plumber and electrician FAQ</h2><!-- site-intent:start --><div class=\"intent-content\" data-site-intent><h3>Separate a current fault from planned replacement work</h3><p>If the request includes both a fault and a proposed renovation fitting, list them separately. Product dimensions, existing connections and access can affect replacement work. Give any building-entry restrictions or parking arrangements when booking; do not purchase a fitting on the assumption that it matches the current installation.</p><ul class=\"intent-links\"><li><a href=\"fixtures-appliances-perth.html\">Fixture and appliance compatibility</a></li><li><a href=\"tap-mixer-repairs-perth.html\">Tap and mixer repair options</a></li><li><a href=\"plumbing.html\">Plumbing work in western Perth</a></li><li><a href=\"electrical.html\">Electrical work in western Perth</a></li></ul><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:0:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:0:answer}}</details></div><!-- site-intent:end --><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:1:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:1:answer}}</details><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:2:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:2:answer}}</details></div></section>" as TrustedHtml,
